", "title": "Vocabulary: Things You Have", "instruction": "Words you can use with 이/가.", "content": {"explanation": {"title": "Useful words"}, "sentences": [{"korean": "시간", "english": "Time", "tts": true, "chunks": [{"display": "시간", "tokens": [{"text": "시간", "meaning": "time"}]}]}, {"korean": "친구", "english": "Friend", "tts": true, "chunks": [{"display": "친구", "tokens": [{"text": "친구", "meaning": "friend"}]}]}, {"korean": "돈", "english": "Money", "tts": true, "chunks": [{"display": "돈", "tokens": [{"text": "돈", "meaning": "money"}]}]}, {"korean": "우유", "english": "Milk", "tts": true, "chunks": [{"display": "우유", "tokens": [{"text": "우유", "meaning": "milk"}]}]}, {"korean": "가방", "english": "Bag", "tts": true, "chunks": [{"display": "가방", "tokens": [{"text": "가방", "meaning": "bag"}]}]}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #1", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"I don't have time.\"", "contentObj": {"sentence": "저는 시간이 없어요.", "translation": "I don't have time.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["저는"], "correct_turtle": ["저는"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '저는' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["시간이"], "correct_turtle": ["시간", "이"], "turtle_explanation": "'이' marks the subject. After a vowel use 가, after a consonant use 이."}, {"id": "e3", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["없어요"], "correct_turtle": ["없어요"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '없어요' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "저는", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "저는", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "가", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "없어요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "시간가", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "없어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "시간이", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o8", "text": "이", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o9", "text": "시간", "mode": "turtle"}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #2", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"Minsu has a friend.\"", "contentObj": {"sentence": "민수는 친구가 있어요.", "translation": "Minsu has a friend.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["민수는"], "correct_turtle": ["민수는"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '민수는' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["친구가"], "correct_turtle": ["친구", "가"], "turtle_explanation": "'가' marks the subject. After a vowel use 가, after a consonant use 이."}, {"id": "e3", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["있어요"], "correct_turtle": ["있어요"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '있어요' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "민수는", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "있어요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "민수는", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "친구이", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "친구가", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "있어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "이", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o8", "text": "가", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o9", "text": "친구", "mode": "turtle"}]}}, {"stepType": "agglutinative_quiz", "title": "Sentence Building #3", "instruction": "Build the sentence: \"Yumi has a book.\"", "contentObj": {"sentence": "유미는 책이 있어요.", "translation": "Yumi has a book.", "elements": [{"id": "e1", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["유미는"], "correct_turtle": ["유미는"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '유미는' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}, {"id": "e2", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["책이"], "correct_turtle": ["책", "이"], "turtle_explanation": "'이' marks the subject. After a vowel use 가, after a consonant use 이."}, {"id": "e3", "isTarget": true, "correct_rabbit": ["있어요"], "correct_turtle": ["있어요"], "turtle_explanation": "Keep '있어요' as one block — it is not this lesson's focus."}], "options": [{"id": "o1", "text": "이", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o2", "text": "있어요", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o3", "text": "책", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o4", "text": "책이", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o5", "text": "있어요", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o6", "text": "유미는", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o7", "text": "책가", "mode": "rabbit"}, {"id": "o8", "text": "가", "mode": "turtle"}, {"id": "o9", "text": "유미는", "mode": "turtle"}]}}, {"step_type": "completion", "title": "Lesson 1 Mastered!", "instruction": "Great! You can now say what you have in Korean.", "content": {"text": "You've learned '[thing]이/가 있어요/없어요.'\nConsonant ending → 이 (시간이), vowel ending → 가 (커피가).", "highlights": ["이", "가", "있어요", "없어요"]}}]}$lsn$::jsonb
